{"title":"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6ff35f9d605211aaffac6cca22719cfb090d91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7a96970366faf688e18153d89d5d56870e0b18d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"21\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e93ba751ce35255e89218b3381437eb6a8b7d4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -12 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28expanding.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(expanding)\">Solution 1 (expanding)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (expanding)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7a96970366faf688e18153d89d5d56870e0b18d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"21\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b035ea84455aaeece5a3251a6929bd3faeaf412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)^{2} = x^2 + (-3) \\times 2 \\times x + (-3)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"298\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fa95879e328207c52d60b3b1dc9ea33267ffc99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=x^2 - 6x + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6ff35f9d605211aaffac6cca22719cfb090d91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/4/9346c29198c4d27c16722326fd60ac63b607bd3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 6x + 9 = (-3)^{2} - 6 \\times -3 + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"270\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/a/19a40e3209fd20f41c4cf32a9077e2701fca62ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=9 + 18 + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0c4269fc7a4eed326ff38e4e6c51762d0dea8c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28plugging_in_at_start.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(plugging_in_at_start)\">Solution 2 (plugging in at start)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (plugging in at start)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6ff35f9d605211aaffac6cca22719cfb090d91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> from the start. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/6/2e6d8fa51f5579a053c75d1730a3c8d22db5e4a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)^{2} = (-3 - 3)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c3f8bd4427420a72541633f4043459cc89ad0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(-6)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0c4269fc7a4eed326ff38e4e6c51762d0dea8c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat\">2015 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Probl